<BaseLayout locale="en" noindex title="Privacy policy | Lahore Fort" description="Privacy policy"><article class="wrap guide-article"><h1>Privacy policy</h1><p>Updated 25 October 2026</p><section><h2>Who publishes this guide?</h2><p>This is an independent nonprofit information guide. We are not the fort operator, WCLA or UNESCO. There are no accounts, ticket sales, payment forms or project contact forms on this website. Following an operator link takes you to a separate service.</p></section><section><h2>Analytics and your choice</h2><p>Google Analytics (G-HXM22WWPKP) is off until a permission can be saved and verified in Cookie settings. A successful allowance may load its script immediately. Rejecting or withdrawing turns it off for this page immediately, attempts to update the stored choice and clears accessible GA cookies. It cannot recall requests already sent. If saving fails, the message explains that this page is off and the earlier stored choice may affect a future page or session. Browser restrictions can prevent storage or cookie changes.</p></section><section><h2>Preferences and local resources</h2><p>The optional preferences flag records your selection; it does not promise to restore a theme or choose the route language. The URL determines the displayed language. The service worker may cache this site’s static resources and previously visited pages for offline use. The weather API is excluded from that offline cache. Offline content can be older; a missing cached page shows an unavailable response rather than a different page.</p></section><section><h2>Weather and embedded maps</h2><p>Weather requests use the fort’s fixed coordinates; this website does not request your device location. The server obtains an Open-Meteo model forecast and may cache validated data for ten minutes. A dated build snapshot can appear before a browser refresh. The embedded Google map connects to Google when loaded; that provider receives normal connection information and applies its own privacy rules. GA settings do not control this map.</p></section><section><h2>Hosting and performance measurement</h2><p>Cloudflare hosts the site and may process connection data and inject a performance or RUM beacon separately from Google Analytics. Our GA choice does not control a hosting beacon. The presence of a script does not establish that a particular visit transmitted telemetry. Read the provider’s data-origin and collection documentation for its service.</p></section><section><h2>Manage browser data</h2><p>Use Cookie settings to change the site’s analytics choice. Browser settings can clear this site’s storage, cookies and offline cache. Clearing them removes saved choices and cached pages. Consult external providers’ policies when using their linked services.</p></section><p><a href="https://developers.cloudflare.com/web-analytics/data-metrics/data-origin-and-collection/">Cloudflare — data origin and collection</a> · <a href="https://open-meteo.com/en/terms">Open-Meteo</a> · <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy">Google</a></p><p><a href="/en/cookies/">Cookie settings</a> · <a href="/CREDITS.txt">Photograph credits</a></p></article></BaseLayout>
